COMMENT ON TABLE "public"."sms_relays" IS 'SMS relay-with-attribution (brief §6): dedicated number bridged to external target mobiles. Created paused; one live relay per number (partial unique); ending releases the number to ''spare''. Service-role writes only — the relay leg outranks conversational routing, so rows are route-mediated (see Phase 6 plan).';



COMMENT ON COLUMN "public"."sms_relays"."bridge_replies" IS 'TRUE: a target reply is forwarded back to the last-forwarded member (bridging map). FALSE: it stays on the relay number and routes to the Inbox — the member reaches the target directly via the mobile in the forward attribution line.';



COMMENT ON COLUMN "public"."sms_relays"."confirmation_template" IS 'One-time reply to the member on their first forwarded message. Supports the same merge tokens as prefix/suffix. NULL = use the built-in default for the relay reply mode; empty string = send no confirmation.';



COMMENT ON COLUMN "public"."sms_relays"."archived_at" IS 'Hygiene archive. Set only after status = ended (number already released). Paused/active relays still intercept inbound.';



